@base = http://localhost:3003
@user = sample-user-id
@key = internal-api-key

@auditA = demo-a-vulnerable-bank
@auditB = demo-b-lending-pool
@auditC = demo-c-simple-wallet
@auditD = demo-d-pending-vault

### 1. Service is up
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. The four audits and their states
GET {{base}}/api/reports
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 3. Audit A: the full report
# @name reportA
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 4. Audit A: the three-way comparison (normal execution, static vs RAG, exploit simulation)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}/comparison
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 5. Audit A: one finding with both detections and its attempts
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}/findings/{{reportA.response.body.findings[0].id}}
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 6. Audit A: normal execution run, with trace
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}/simulations/baseline
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 7. Audit A: the exploit run, with code and trace
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}/simulations/{{reportA.response.body.findings[0].components.simulation.attempts[0].id}}
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 8. Audit B: a finding only RAG caught, two reverted attempts
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditB}}/comparison
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 9. Audit C: skipped by the gate
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditC}}/comparison
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 10. Audit D: still running, partial report
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditD}}
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 11. Audit D: comparison shows what is not available yet and why
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditD}}/comparison
x-user-id: {{user}}

### 12. Severity definitions
GET {{base}}/api/reports/meta/severity-levels
x-user-id: {{user}}

### Access checks

### Another user cannot read audit A (404)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}
x-user-id: someone-else

### No user header (401)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/{{auditA}}

### Ingest without the service key (401)
POST {{base}}/internal/audits
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Ingest with a bad body (400)
POST {{base}}/internal/audits/{{auditD}}/static
x-service-key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "failed", "findings": [] }